{"title":"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many times must one shoot at this target, and which rings must one hit in order to score exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> points?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/9/ca92e43d47d5fa16d0bd1cd84cb92dee8d52e9d8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw(circle((0,0),1),black); draw(circle((0,0),2),black); draw(circle((0,0),3),black); draw(circle((0,0),4),black); draw(circle((0,0),5),black); draw(circle((0,0),6),black); MP(&quot;40&quot;,(0,0-.3),N); MP(&quot;39&quot;,(0,1-.1),N); MP(&quot;24&quot;,(0,2-.1),N); MP(&quot;23&quot;,(0,3-.1),N); MP(&quot;17&quot;,(0,4-.1),N); MP(&quot;16&quot;,(0,5-.1),N); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We can try combinations of numbers that add to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. We soon find that one must shoot at the target <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times and hit the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> ring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times and hit the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> ring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/1/211471b44c15400b0676022c09e70a5bd8fd20c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100=2^2\\cdot5^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" />, we can take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/c/4ec35d7a7e3a2ded232904e1769538191e42cb7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/1/0d18453cf7868fc5cc1955bdd1f945819c3cf2aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" /> of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers. From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/c/4ec35d7a7e3a2ded232904e1769538191e42cb7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" /> we have the set (in order) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/d/a6d9cc8d21b583d7338f4f80bf9c4a168f9bda34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${15,14,-1,-2,-8,16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"166\" height=\"17\" />, and from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/1/0d18453cf7868fc5cc1955bdd1f945819c3cf2aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" /> we have the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/85649e9eee1d595c8e7ccdf06fbeebb4d09a322b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${0,-1,0,-1,1,0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"17\" />. We notice that as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/3/1f3cc0ad966b3e637cd199607cbf0d1befc0e491.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"20\" /> times <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, we probably have two times more <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />s than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />s, and it works perfectly, so one has to shoot the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> ring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times and the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> ring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II\">1993 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1993 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Colorado_Math_Contest\" title=\"University of Northern Colorado Math Contest\"> All UNCO Math Contest Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017083139\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 186/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1363/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 100/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4706/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.